<title>USA: Donnelly Corp ships parts to Mercedes-Benz.</title>
<headline>Donnelly Corp ships parts to Mercedes-Benz.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLAND, Mich. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donnelly Corp said on Thursday it is currently shipping parts to Mercedes-Benz, a unit of Daimler-Benz AG, for the automaker's first complete overhead trim and lighting system in its new sport utility vehicle, the AAV.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not announced, but the company expects to ship components for 65,000 overhead systems each year. Donnelly also provides the glass for the AAV's sunroof.</p>
<p>Donnelly makes specialty glass products for the automobile industry. Its shares were unchanged Thursday at 17-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
